  "title": "Oatmeal Cinnamon Cookies",
  "description": "Oatmeal cinnamon cookies, made with oats, brown sugar, vanilla, and cinnamon chips, are sweet and chewy. This recipe is quick and easy to prepare.",
  "authors": [
